seg-9100800daa1c = This document maps the RTCA (formerly the Radio Technical Commission for Aeronautics) <b>DO-229E</b> (SBAS (satellite-based augmentation system) MOPS (minimum operational performance standards)) and <b>DO-316</b> (GPS/SBAS (GPS: Global Positioning System) airborne equipment) protection-level and integrity-monitoring requirements to the Kshana functions that implement them. It is an <b>engineering traceability aid</b>, not a statement that any requirement is met — Kshana implements the published algorithms; it is not approved avionics.

